window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Think deep.</p> <p>The deep of the sea, the deep of space, the deep of our souls, our fears...ourselves.</p> <p>Fear not the monsters under your bed—but the mermaids under your boat.</p> <p><i>Merciless Mermaids: Tails from the Deep</i> features 30 original stories and poems by Mercedes Lackey, Rick Wilber, D.J. Butler, Gama Ray Martinez, Julia Vee, Ken Bebelle, and many others. </p> <p>From Japanese legends to mafia mermen, from carnival freaks to flying aces, from bayou legends to kraken-like behemoths, these tales explore the darker side of merfolk: desire, envy, love unfulfilled, grace ungranted, and loneliness turned to rage....</p> <p>Can you see the shapes in the waters that watch you?</p> <p>Do you hear the lure of a siren’s call?</p> <p>Can you feel the mermaid’s eyes upon you?</p> <p>Compiled by <i>New York Times</i> best-selling author Kevin J. Anderson, award-winning editor Allyson Longueira, and their publishing graduate students at Western Colorado University.</p> <p>Deep down, you know that the darkness has a tail....</p>"; 
